2. **`filter` and `indexOf` (Method 2):** This is a classic approach. While it works perfectly, it can be less performant for very large arrays because `indexOf` runs inside the loop, leading to $O(n^2)$ time complexity in the worst case.

**For most use cases, use Method 1.**

